WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 42= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:44.640 --> 01:46.280
I've always loved you with all my heart.

8
01:50.519 --> 01:52.519
Now that we have a child,

9
01:55.359 --> 01:57.719
surely you can tell me where they came from.

10
02:15.340 --> 02:19.460
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

11
02:22.420 --> 02:26.380
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

12
02:28.380 --> 02:31.900
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

13
02:32.620 --> 02:35.420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

14
02:36.140 --> 02:38.420
♪Though all the world may fade♪

15
02:38.420 --> 02:41.260
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

16
02:42.759 --> 02:45.840
Little toes, let's stretch them.

17
02:46.439 --> 02:48.680
Stretch them all the way to Nanshan.

18
02:49.919 --> 02:52.280
There's a treasure in Nanshan.

19
02:53.280 --> 02:55.560
The treasure has a mountain of gold.

20
02:56.719 --> 03:00.759
And on that mountain lie 1.2 hectares of fields.

21
03:01.319 --> 03:05.479
0.5 hectares are planted with buckwheat.

22
03:06.400 --> 03:10.719
The buckwheat feeds the little chicks.

23
03:11.479 --> 03:15.280
But the little chicks won't eat.

24
03:16.159 --> 03:17.599
Have you forgotten, Young Master?

25
03:19.912 --> 03:22.328
You brought them back to the residence yourself,

26
03:26.904 --> 03:28.840
yet you're asking me where they came from.

27
03:33.940 --> 03:38.140
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

28
03:40.940 --> 03:44.940
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

29
03:46.900 --> 03:50.500
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

30
03:51.180 --> 03:53.740
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

31
03:54.900 --> 04:00.580
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

32
04:01.020 --> 04:05.140
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

33
04:05.140 --> 04:08.300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

34
04:08.660 --> 04:12.260
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

35
04:12.260 --> 04:14.940
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

36
04:14.940 --> 04:19.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

37
04:19.340 --> 04:22.340
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

38
04:22.340 --> 04:26.340
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

39
04:26.340 --> 04:30.420
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

40
04:36.560 --> 04:38.600
I just saw Jinqi rush out.

41
04:39.079 --> 04:39.959
Is something wrong?

42
04:41.279 --> 04:42.959
Old Master needed to see him urgently.

43
04:45.079 --> 04:45.839
Look.

44
04:46.439 --> 04:47.480
Someone's hungry.

45
04:48.879 --> 04:50.120
No more sucking on your hand, Zhangcheng.

46
04:50.279 --> 04:51.439
Zhangcheng is awake.

47
04:53.000 --> 04:54.160
Let me hold her.

48
04:54.160 --> 04:57.220
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

49
04:59.020 --> 05:02.620
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

50
05:03.340 --> 05:06.060
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

51
05:07.060 --> 05:12.780
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

52
05:36.279 --> 05:38.319
You came here all worked up,

53
05:39.399 --> 05:41.639
yet you haven't said a word since you arrived.

54
05:46.639 --> 05:48.000
I remember Grandfather

55
05:48.296 --> 05:50.200
was never particularly fond of Li Yingqiu.

56
05:51.120 --> 05:51.920
So why

57
05:52.632 --> 05:54.840
do you cherish this Cold Mountain Painting so much?

58
05:56.040 --> 05:57.319
Even during festivals,

59
05:58.152 --> 05:59.830
instead of spending time with the family,

60
06:00.296 --> 06:01.992
you keep this painting by your side,

61
06:04.199 --> 06:05.360
as though

62
06:07.752 --> 06:09.430
you were sitting with an old friend.

63
06:22.480 --> 06:23.439
Now

64
06:24.639 --> 06:26.160
that you're a father, too,

65
06:27.600 --> 06:29.639
there are some things I can finally tell you.

66
06:31.639 --> 06:33.360
This Cold Mountain Painting

67
06:39.240 --> 06:42.199
was a treasured piece in Grand Secretary Shen's collection.

68
06:55.688 --> 06:57.720
After the Shen family was stripped of its property,

69
06:58.560 --> 06:59.920
by a twist of fate,

70
07:00.800 --> 07:03.199
your father-in-law recognized its worth

71
07:03.759 --> 07:05.120
and acquired it for his shop.

72
07:05.759 --> 07:07.720
Only then did I have the chance to see it again.

73
07:26.160 --> 07:26.959
No wonder.

74
08:02.720 --> 08:05.079
Now, seeing you siblings

75
08:05.879 --> 08:08.600
raise families and live well,

76
08:10.800 --> 08:14.199
I don't regret choosing to save my own life back then.

77
08:17.600 --> 08:20.800
But in the end, I failed to preserve my integrity in my later years.

78
08:23.959 --> 08:26.199
I failed the teachings of the sages,

79
08:29.279 --> 08:32.639
and Grand Secretary Shen's faith in me.

80
08:48.960 --> 08:50.480
I remember

81
08:51.200 --> 08:52.600
you once arranged a marriage

82
08:53.320 --> 08:55.840
between me and Young Lady Shen Jialan.

83
08:57.799 --> 08:58.720
What kind of

84
09:01.919 --> 09:03.120
young lady was she?

85
09:07.320 --> 09:08.559
I met her once

86
09:09.080 --> 09:10.480
when she was six.

87
09:11.879 --> 09:15.240
Pure and unspoiled, with a natural air of grace.

88
09:16.799 --> 09:18.240
Though she was a girl,

89
09:18.919 --> 09:19.960
Grand Secretary Shen

90
09:20.799 --> 09:23.720
treasured her dearly and taught her with great care.

91
09:27.000 --> 09:28.799
That's all in the past.

92
09:29.544 --> 09:30.968
There's no need to speak of it now.

93
09:37.759 --> 09:38.559
Grandfather.

94
09:40.960 --> 09:42.200
I still have letters to answer.

95
09:43.159 --> 09:44.000
I'll take my leave.

96
09:51.120 --> 09:53.559
(Grand Secretary Shen Qihan.)

97
09:53.848 --> 09:56.184
(For deceiving the sovereign and betraying imperial favor,)

98
09:56.216 --> 09:58.030
(and for disloyalty in matters of state,)

99
09:58.200 --> 10:02.480
(all male members of the Shen family are to be executed.)

100
10:02.720 --> 10:06.799
(The women are to be enslaved in the Imperial Music Bureau.)

101
10:07.080 --> 10:10.600
(All property is to be confiscated by the state.)

102
10:11.279 --> 10:14.159
You lie beneath the earth, your bones turned to dust.

103
10:15.360 --> 10:19.120
I remain in this world, my hair white as snow.

104
10:25.679 --> 10:27.440
I remain in this world,

105
10:30.919 --> 10:32.720
my hair white as snow.

106
10:43.980 --> 10:47.300
(Created by Li Yingqiu of Heyang)

107
11:09.720 --> 11:10.399
Young Madam.

108
11:15.399 --> 11:16.639
Why bring a brazier in here

109
11:17.080 --> 11:18.559
in the middle of summer?

110
11:19.304 --> 11:20.480
Young Master asked for it.

111
11:54.440 --> 11:55.919
I was too blinded by appearances.

112
11:58.679 --> 11:59.919
From beginning to end,

113
12:02.759 --> 12:04.480
I was the one who wronged you.

114
12:07.919 --> 12:09.320
You never wronged me.

115
12:48.820 --> 12:51.580
(Zhichun Hall Daily Expense Account Book)

116
13:49.279 --> 13:50.519
You are Xu Lanxiang.

117
13:53.240 --> 13:53.879
We

118
13:54.648 --> 13:56.910
are husband and wife who share every sorrow and joy,

119
13:58.559 --> 14:01.120
and face every fortune and misfortune together.

120
14:19.220 --> 14:21.660
♪The golden sunset♪

121
14:21.660 --> 14:25.020
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

122
14:26.780 --> 14:29.260
♪All things fall silent♪

123
14:29.260 --> 14:32.820
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

124
14:33.540 --> 14:36.580
♪My restless heart♪

125
14:36.580 --> 14:40.220
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

126
14:40.940 --> 14:46.900
♪I wonder if the past has ever been heard♪

127
14:50.240 --> 14:50.919
You...

128
14:51.112 --> 14:51.910
Aren't you afraid?

129
14:54.039 --> 14:55.639
Can I save up all the credit and ask

130
14:55.640 --> 14:57.760
for everything at once when I've decided what I want?

131
15:01.399 --> 15:03.960
I have to go.

132
15:08.200 --> 15:09.736
We have plenty of time ahead of us.

133
15:10.120 --> 15:11.080
As long as we care,

134
15:11.200 --> 15:12.399
our bond will never be broken.

135
15:12.400 --> 15:14.584
Didn't you say it blooms at night and smells wonderful?

136
15:15.159 --> 15:16.120
I have feelings for Lady Xu.

137
15:16.600 --> 15:17.840
I wish to marry her.

138
15:18.159 --> 15:19.159
From this day forward,

139
15:19.240 --> 15:21.320
we are husband and wife, sharing both fortune and misfortune.

140
15:21.320 --> 15:22.000
Stop!

141
15:22.120 --> 15:23.240
Prefect Liu, are you trying

142
15:23.240 --> 15:25.096
to indirectly cause my husband's death today?

143
15:29.200 --> 15:30.120
I'm no gentleman.

144
15:31.120 --> 15:31.919
I get scared.

145
15:33.080 --> 15:34.120
I act on impulse.

146
15:35.120 --> 15:36.559
But for as long as I live,

147
15:38.080 --> 15:39.080
I will never betray you.

148
15:39.080 --> 15:41.100
♪And leave the grass and trees covered in frost♪

149
15:41.100 --> 15:45.060
♪I only wish that where the lights grow dim♪

150
15:45.340 --> 15:51.380
♪You and I will walk there together♪

151
16:03.380 --> 16:04.820
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

152
16:05.460 --> 16:14.720
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

153
16:14.720 --> 16:16.728
Before Fourth Young Lady's bridal gift ceremony,

154
16:17.360 --> 16:17.960
the First Madam

155
16:19.399 --> 16:21.840
discovered a dark patch on her abdomen.

156
16:22.559 --> 16:24.080
It had ulcerated and begun to bleed.

157
16:25.360 --> 16:27.320
She secretly sent for a physician,

158
16:29.240 --> 16:30.679
who said it was a malignant sore

159
16:31.919 --> 16:33.440
and there was no cure.

160
16:36.120 --> 16:38.080
The First Madam kept it from everyone

161
16:39.176 --> 16:40.630
and strictly ordered Yinchen and me

162
16:42.080 --> 16:43.919
not to breathe a word of it.

163
16:50.120 --> 16:50.919
That's impossible.

164
16:52.248 --> 16:54.776
The physician you found must have been incompetent.

165
17:01.720 --> 17:04.130
The Treatise on the Origins and Symptoms of Diseases states,

166
17:04.440 --> 17:09.000
"When a sore itches, aches, burns, swells, and oozes profusely,

167
17:09.480 --> 17:10.640
accompanied by a high fever,

168
17:11.200 --> 17:13.039
it is known as a malignant sore."

169
17:13.368 --> 17:14.440
It is difficult to heal

170
17:14.696 --> 17:15.790
and difficult to treat.

171
17:16.488 --> 17:17.960
If it develops on the hands or feet,

172
17:18.319 --> 17:19.839
amputation

173
17:20.160 --> 17:21.880
may offer a slim chance of survival.

174
17:22.720 --> 17:25.400
But when it develops on the abdomen...

175
17:26.160 --> 17:28.839
The infection has now spread deep into her internal organs.

176
17:29.759 --> 17:33.319
Your Lordship, you should make funeral arrangements as soon as possible.

177
17:52.599 --> 17:54.119
I have failed you as a son.

178
17:55.359 --> 17:56.960
You were unwell,

179
17:57.680 --> 17:59.079
yet I never noticed.

180
18:02.839 --> 18:03.640
It seems

181
18:05.359 --> 18:07.480
experience still wins out in the end.

182
18:11.880 --> 18:13.319
You little rascal.

183
18:15.480 --> 18:17.319
In the end, you still can't escape

184
18:17.440 --> 18:19.680
the Buddha's palm.

185
18:23.920 --> 18:25.839
How could my little schemes

186
18:27.640 --> 18:29.880
ever compare with your great wisdom?

187
18:51.400 --> 18:53.799
Birth, aging, illness, and death

188
18:54.240 --> 18:56.279
are inevitable parts of life.

189
18:58.039 --> 18:59.759
You're with child.

190
19:01.319 --> 19:03.279
You may grieve for me,

191
19:04.680 --> 19:07.119
but you mustn't let yourself be consumed by sorrow

192
19:07.400 --> 19:09.279
and harm your health.

193
19:14.200 --> 19:15.119
Otherwise,

194
19:16.680 --> 19:18.599
even after I'm gone,

195
19:19.319 --> 19:21.279
I'll never be at peace.

196
19:24.160 --> 19:25.079
I understand.

197
19:28.000 --> 19:29.279
Taking good care of myself

198
19:31.359 --> 19:33.079
and living well

199
19:35.319 --> 19:36.920
will be the greatest way

200
19:38.559 --> 19:40.119
to honor you.

201
19:43.319 --> 19:47.160
That's the daughter I raised.

202
20:00.599 --> 20:01.759
Lanxiang.

203
20:09.680 --> 20:10.559
Mother.

204
20:13.880 --> 20:15.160
Jinqi

205
20:16.079 --> 20:19.079
knows what he's doing.

206
20:19.920 --> 20:21.359
I don't worry about him.

207
20:23.160 --> 20:24.119
The only one

208
20:25.039 --> 20:27.599
I can't stop worrying about is Xiushu.

209
20:29.000 --> 20:30.319
This world

210
20:31.359 --> 20:33.319
is harsh on women.

211
20:36.279 --> 20:38.960
But seeing how you treat Xiulai,

212
20:39.920 --> 20:41.079
Xiuru,

213
20:42.039 --> 20:43.319
and Suhua,

214
20:46.440 --> 20:48.920
I can finally put my mind at ease.

215
20:51.240 --> 20:52.359
Don't worry, Mother.

216
20:53.519 --> 20:55.400
I've watched Xiushu grow up.

217
20:56.640 --> 20:58.319
I will never let anyone mistreat her.

218
21:05.960 --> 21:08.119
Ever since you married into the Lin family,

219
21:11.720 --> 21:13.920
because of your background,

220
21:15.920 --> 21:19.079
I've always treated you coldly.

221
21:25.319 --> 21:27.519
I was foolish.

222
21:28.440 --> 21:30.079
I've wronged you.

223
21:34.319 --> 21:35.960
Though you never cared for me,

224
21:36.792 --> 21:39.260
you never treated me harshly or made things difficult for me.

225
21:40.079 --> 21:42.920
Instead, you often stood up for me before the elders.

226
21:44.279 --> 21:47.039
Even if you only did it for Young Master's sake,

227
21:47.240 --> 21:48.790
I still benefited from your kindness

228
21:50.519 --> 21:51.680
and have always been grateful.

229
22:08.559 --> 22:11.200
These are the household authority tokens.

230
22:15.400 --> 22:16.920
From now on,

231
22:17.960 --> 22:18.960
the Lin Residence

232
22:19.920 --> 22:22.000
is in your hands.

233
22:34.599 --> 22:36.400
My Xiushu

234
22:37.200 --> 22:38.359
is also entrusted

235
22:39.599 --> 22:40.160
to you...

236
22:47.799 --> 22:48.359
Mother.

237
23:53.680 --> 23:54.119
Mother...

238
23:54.160 --> 23:54.720
Mother.

239
23:59.279 --> 23:59.880
Mother!

240
23:59.960 --> 24:00.839
Mother!

241
24:01.480 --> 24:02.400
Mother!

242
24:03.519 --> 24:04.440
Grandmother!

243
24:04.839 --> 24:05.960
Aunt Shunhua!

244
24:05.960 --> 24:06.880
Mother!

245
24:09.799 --> 24:10.839
Aunt Shunhua!

246
24:10.839 --> 24:13.780
♪Through rise and fall, people meet and part as they always do♪

247
24:14.220 --> 24:19.820
♪Each plant endures its own trials before reaching shore♪

248
24:20.180 --> 24:23.180
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

249
24:23.180 --> 24:26.540
♪Plum blossoms bloom, enduring the frost♪

250
24:26.540 --> 24:32.300
♪Yet their proud spirit fades with wind and snow♪

251
24:32.300 --> 24:35.580
♪Bamboo shadows embrace quiet contentment♪

252
24:35.580 --> 24:38.620
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

253
24:38.620 --> 24:44.180
♪Watching the old and new take turns in this world♪

254
24:44.380 --> 24:50.100
♪Spring comes, and I smile upon a garden in full bloom♪

255
24:50.460 --> 24:56.420
♪Autumn passes, and I let the blossoms fade away♪

256
24:56.780 --> 25:00.580
♪A scroll of time slowly unfolds♪

257
25:00.580 --> 25:09.300
♪I read every joy and sorrow behind the curtain♪

258
25:10.920 --> 25:12.880
First Madam!

259
25:13.640 --> 25:14.960
First Madam!

260
25:14.960 --> 25:16.319
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

261
25:16.319 --> 25:17.640
First Madam!

262
25:18.079 --> 25:19.440
It's broad daylight.

263
25:19.450 --> 25:21.150
Why are you wailing as if someone has died?

264
25:21.160 --> 25:22.440
How utterly improper.

265
25:25.519 --> 25:26.240
Master.

266
25:27.920 --> 25:29.559
The First Madam has passed away.

267
25:48.599 --> 25:49.319
Changzheng.

268
25:51.160 --> 25:52.559
Shunhua is gone.

269
25:55.880 --> 25:56.839
Shunhua...

270
26:00.000 --> 26:01.359
is gone.

271
26:03.559 --> 26:06.400
Aunt Shunhua passed away so suddenly.

272
26:08.079 --> 26:09.279
With such a large household,

273
26:10.079 --> 26:12.880
now there's no one to manage its affairs.

274
26:14.359 --> 26:16.119
But Aunt Shunhua's funeral

275
26:16.519 --> 26:17.920
still needs to be arranged.

276
26:19.039 --> 26:21.119
This is far too important to neglect.

277
26:22.599 --> 26:23.200
If

278
26:24.359 --> 26:25.680
it isn't handled properly,

279
26:26.359 --> 26:27.519
Uncle Changzheng

280
26:28.960 --> 26:30.559
will lose face as well.

281
26:34.519 --> 26:35.519
In the past,

282
26:36.359 --> 26:37.680
all the affairs of the residence

283
26:38.920 --> 26:40.680
were handled by your Aunt Shunhua.

284
26:41.480 --> 26:41.920
But...

285
26:42.640 --> 26:43.319
now,

286
26:43.640 --> 26:45.960
what are we supposed to do?

287
26:47.400 --> 26:49.920
Shunhua and I were as close as sisters.

288
26:50.759 --> 26:51.920
She was gravely ill,

289
26:53.759 --> 26:55.839
yet she never told me a thing.

290
26:59.880 --> 27:01.079
And now,

291
27:03.976 --> 27:06.350
she's even left the household in the Young Madam's hands.

292
27:10.680 --> 27:13.759
After all these years as sisters,

293
27:17.200 --> 27:21.079
she didn't trust me at all.

294
27:23.599 --> 27:26.039
It breaks my heart.

295
27:26.519 --> 27:27.920
Lanxiang was born a servant,

296
27:28.599 --> 27:30.680
so her knowledge and experience are limited.

297
27:31.880 --> 27:33.839
She's never dealt with anything this important.

298
27:34.559 --> 27:37.079
She's bound to make mistakes

299
27:37.599 --> 27:39.079
and make a laughingstock of herself.

300
27:41.480 --> 27:43.960
Why don't you leave Aunt Shunhua's funeral

301
27:45.160 --> 27:46.720
to me?

302
27:51.559 --> 27:52.599
You have a point.

303
27:53.839 --> 27:54.799
I'll leave it to you.

304
27:55.096 --> 27:56.056
You can handle it.

305
27:59.079 --> 27:59.720
All right.

306
27:59.800 --> 28:01.480
Mother already made all the arrangements.

307
28:03.599 --> 28:04.799
Father, you needn't worry.

308
28:07.680 --> 28:10.319
You must be beside yourself with grief.

309
28:10.519 --> 28:12.279
Your mother has already passed away.

310
28:12.400 --> 28:15.000
How could she have arranged her own funeral?

311
28:15.519 --> 28:16.359
Exactly.

312
28:16.920 --> 28:19.200
Everyone in the Lin Residence can only rely on me now.

313
28:27.480 --> 28:28.279
Fengxian,

314
28:29.119 --> 28:31.559
may I ask which feng shui master in the city we should hire?

315
28:34.759 --> 28:35.160
Well...

316
28:37.440 --> 28:38.400
How would I know

317
28:39.279 --> 28:40.319
on such short notice?

318
28:40.400 --> 28:42.440
The First Madam already chose a feng shui master.

319
28:42.960 --> 28:43.920
Head Butler Yang,

320
28:44.119 --> 28:46.400
take some men with Young Master's calling card at once

321
28:46.559 --> 28:48.200
and invite Mister Zuo from Bajiao Street.

322
28:48.440 --> 28:49.119
Yes.

323
28:51.839 --> 28:52.920
Fengxian,

324
28:53.256 --> 28:55.224
where are the First Madam's burial clothes?

325
28:55.720 --> 28:58.119
Who will dress her in them for the initial encoffining?

326
28:59.720 --> 29:01.240
Aunt Shunhua passed away so suddenly.

327
29:01.250 --> 29:03.256
How could she possibly have burial clothes ready?

328
29:03.830 --> 29:05.144
Shouldn't we hurry and buy them?

329
29:14.168 --> 29:16.790
The First Madam's burial clothes are in the rear house attic,

330
29:16.920 --> 29:18.680
inside the largest camphorwood chest.

331
29:19.240 --> 29:21.160
Wei, take some people and bring them here.

332
29:21.920 --> 29:22.440
Yes.

333
29:26.160 --> 29:26.839
Madam Wu.

334
29:28.728 --> 29:30.030
Once the burial clothes arrive,

335
29:30.480 --> 29:32.559
please help me

336
29:33.279 --> 29:34.720
dress the First Madam in them.

337
29:36.039 --> 29:36.839
Let us attend to her

338
29:37.440 --> 29:38.480
one last time.

339
29:40.839 --> 29:41.960
Rest assured, Young Madam.

340
29:53.160 --> 29:53.799
Xiulai,

341
29:54.200 --> 29:55.359
Mother's coffin

342
29:55.608 --> 29:57.640
is in the right-side room behind the family shrine.

343
29:58.359 --> 29:59.799
Take a few careful servants

344
29:59.896 --> 30:01.016
and have them carry it over.

345
30:01.128 --> 30:02.070
Keep a close eye on it.

346
30:02.328 --> 30:03.992
Don't let it get so much as a single bump.

347
30:06.790 --> 30:07.832
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

348
30:13.160 --> 30:13.759
Xiuwan.

349
30:14.359 --> 30:15.039
Suhua.

350
30:16.910 --> 30:19.130
Mother also had the mourning clothes and funeral banners

351
30:19.144 --> 30:20.088
prepared in advance.

352
30:20.279 --> 30:22.319
They're against the left wall in the storeroom.

353
30:22.552 --> 30:24.030
Take some people and bring them out,

354
30:24.072 --> 30:25.110
and then distribute them.

355
30:25.688 --> 30:26.920
- All right. - All right.

356
30:37.400 --> 30:38.119
Lanxiang.

357
30:38.880 --> 30:40.039
What can I do?

358
30:45.400 --> 30:47.000
I'll leave what Mother cared about most

359
30:47.640 --> 30:48.880
to you, Xiuru.

360
30:50.200 --> 30:53.080
There will be many people and much to attend to during the funeral.

361
30:53.400 --> 30:54.279
Xiuru, please

362
30:54.680 --> 30:56.240
be sure to take good care of Xiushu.

363
31:01.039 --> 31:02.119
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

364
31:02.960 --> 31:04.799
I'll make sure Mother can rest in peace.

365
31:11.680 --> 31:13.160
Once the feng shui master arrives

366
31:13.368 --> 31:15.200
and sets the time for the final encoffining

367
31:15.272 --> 31:16.840
and the date of the funeral procession,

368
31:17.270 --> 31:19.944
have Jinqiao and Jincen go to each residence to announce the death.

369
31:20.072 --> 31:22.440
That will give our relatives and friends time to prepare.

370
31:24.920 --> 31:25.359
All right.

371
31:27.000 --> 31:27.759
Then I...

372
31:30.632 --> 31:31.830
Mother has pain in her chest.

373
31:32.920 --> 31:34.240
I'll take her back to rest first.

374
31:38.344 --> 31:39.240
Let's go, Mother.

375
31:39.599 --> 31:40.400
Shunhua...

376
31:47.240 --> 31:47.680
Father.

377
31:48.872 --> 31:50.536
So, is everything properly arranged?

378
31:51.599 --> 31:53.000
If anything is amiss,

379
31:54.160 --> 31:55.400
please correct me.

380
31:56.920 --> 31:57.599
I wouldn't...

381
32:01.352 --> 32:02.472
Everything is in order.

382
32:02.808 --> 32:03.736
Everything is in order.

383
32:05.880 --> 32:08.480
Since your mother put you in charge of the household,

384
32:09.079 --> 32:10.440
do your best.

385
32:11.599 --> 32:12.599
Your grandfather

386
32:13.359 --> 32:14.799
must be grieving terribly.

387
32:15.400 --> 32:17.119
I'll go keep him company.

388
32:22.460 --> 32:26.740
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

389
32:32.980 --> 32:39.100
(Upholding the Virtue of Generations Past)

390
32:39.100 --> 32:43.540
(Spirit Tablet of Madam Qin of the Lin Family)

391
32:46.640 --> 32:48.839
I was only following Mother's wishes

392
32:48.920 --> 32:50.824
and saying whatever I could to reassure Master.

393
32:53.480 --> 32:55.039
How do you know everything?

394
32:56.279 --> 32:57.400
You even know exactly

395
32:59.432 --> 33:00.790
where the burial clothes are.

396
33:28.200 --> 33:29.480
(For the feng shui master,)

397
33:30.039 --> 33:32.480
(invite Mister Zuo from Bajiao Street.)

398
33:33.920 --> 33:37.480
(The burial clothes are in the attic of the rear house at Rongzhang House,)

399
33:38.039 --> 33:39.920
(inside the largest camphorwood chest.)

400
33:41.519 --> 33:45.200
(The coffin is in the right-side room behind the family shrine.)

401
33:47.039 --> 33:48.359
(During the initial encoffining,)

402
33:49.240 --> 33:52.880
(Lanxiang and Madam Wu will dress me in the burial clothes.)

403
33:55.640 --> 33:59.480
(Once the time for the final encoffining and the funeral date are set,)

404
34:01.240 --> 34:03.240
(go to each residence to announce the death,)

405
34:06.000 --> 34:07.160
(so our relatives and friends)

406
34:07.720 --> 34:09.320
(have time to prepare.)

407
34:10.100 --> 34:13.580
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

408
34:15.020 --> 34:18.100
♪And the worries etched between our brows♪

409
34:19.180 --> 34:23.540
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

410
34:23.540 --> 34:26.860
♪While two pairs of eyes watch from below♪

411
34:31.840 --> 34:32.800
Give this to me.

412
34:34.340 --> 34:37.740
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

413
34:38.740 --> 34:43.300
♪Four seasons wax and wane, year after year♪

414
34:43.300 --> 34:46.500
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

415
34:47.620 --> 34:50.580
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

416
34:51.400 --> 34:53.039
Thank you for persuading me to resign

417
34:53.280 --> 34:54.440
and return to Jinling.

418
34:56.039 --> 34:58.039
Only then could I stay by Mother's side

419
34:58.568 --> 35:00.110
and fulfill some of my duty as her son.

420
35:01.519 --> 35:02.039
Otherwise,

421
35:02.760 --> 35:04.440
I'd still be in the capital now,

422
35:05.280 --> 35:07.280
and I'm afraid I wouldn't even have seen Mother

423
35:08.840 --> 35:09.760
one last time.

424
35:12.020 --> 35:15.220
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

425
35:16.260 --> 35:20.620
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

426
35:20.670 --> 35:23.256
It was also because you were willing to listen, Young Master.

427
35:28.280 --> 35:30.039
Mother was a wise woman.

428
35:32.119 --> 35:33.800
She and Father didn't get along,

429
35:34.920 --> 35:36.960
but she never took it out on the younger generation.

430
35:39.239 --> 35:41.719
Xiulai, Xiuru,

431
35:41.840 --> 35:42.960
and Jinlan

432
35:43.719 --> 35:45.880
were never neglected

433
35:46.920 --> 35:48.599
in manners, learning, or upbringing.

434
35:49.752 --> 35:51.510
They all have very different personalities,

435
35:53.760 --> 35:55.480
but they are all good at heart.

436
35:58.519 --> 36:00.719
Ever since I was little, Mother told me

437
36:01.880 --> 36:03.719
that one tree alone cannot make a forest.

438
36:07.592 --> 36:09.480
I had to treat my younger siblings sincerely

439
36:11.960 --> 36:14.000
for them to treat me sincerely in return.

440
36:18.039 --> 36:19.079
She also told me

441
36:21.039 --> 36:22.039
that Xiuru

442
36:23.360 --> 36:24.960
may seem gentle but is strong-willed,

443
36:29.440 --> 36:31.440
so Xiushu should spend more time with her,

444
36:35.039 --> 36:36.400
lest she be left alone

445
36:38.639 --> 36:39.719
to dwell on things

446
36:41.159 --> 36:42.119
and go astray.

447
37:03.599 --> 37:04.440
Just cry.

448
37:07.719 --> 37:09.159
As children,

449
37:12.328 --> 37:13.720
we wish to care for our parents,

450
37:14.456 --> 37:16.392
but they may be gone before we have the chance.

451
37:24.760 --> 37:26.199
I'll cry with you.

452
37:28.900 --> 37:33.700
♪Even if these trials consume my whole life♪

453
37:34.100 --> 37:38.260
♪I'll only return to the moment our fate began♪

454
37:38.660 --> 37:41.900
♪I've searched and searched, wandering in circles♪

455
37:41.900 --> 37:44.900
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

456
37:45.260 --> 37:47.820
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

457
37:48.260 --> 37:52.740
♪Thankfully, these trials have spared me a lifetime♪

458
37:53.020 --> 37:58.140
♪In this life and the next, it will always be you♪

459
37:58.780 --> 38:07.140
♪I only pray that fate lets us meet sooner♪

460
38:16.440 --> 38:18.580
Aunt Shunhua must have been delirious from her illness

461
38:18.599 --> 38:19.880
and misled by that servant.

462
38:20.744 --> 38:21.630
Mother is kindhearted,

463
38:21.640 --> 38:23.690
but you can't just let that servant do as she pleases.

464
38:24.679 --> 38:26.480
Aunt Shunhua cared about her dignity.

465
38:26.880 --> 38:27.840
We can't let her become

466
38:28.400 --> 38:29.912
a laughingstock even after her death.

467
38:31.159 --> 38:32.840
When I gave birth to Jincen,

468
38:34.280 --> 38:35.280
I had a difficult labor.

469
38:37.440 --> 38:39.719
It was Shunhua who sent for a physician

470
38:41.400 --> 38:43.400
and stayed by my side the entire time.

471
38:43.960 --> 38:45.360
She practically

472
38:45.800 --> 38:48.920
pulled me back from the brink of death.

473
38:52.400 --> 38:54.079
Mother, you mustn't let Aunt Shunhua down.

474
38:54.360 --> 38:55.920
You must keep the Lin family together.

475
39:00.000 --> 39:00.800
But Shunhua...

476
39:03.000 --> 39:05.800
Shunhua already put the Young Madam in charge of the household.

477
39:09.760 --> 39:10.840
There's still Old Master.

478
39:10.920 --> 39:12.400
As long as Old Master gives the word,

479
39:13.280 --> 39:15.280
that servant has no right to run the Lin family.

480
39:25.260 --> 39:28.260
(Legacy and Glory)

481
39:33.880 --> 39:34.679
Aunt Lanxiang.

482
39:41.400 --> 39:42.960
Why have you come to the family shrine?

483
39:43.440 --> 39:44.760
Why aren't you with Mother?

484
39:45.100 --> 39:48.159
(Lu Jun, age 15. Lu Yingzhi, age 11 Lin Xiulai's son and daughter)

485
39:48.159 --> 39:49.159
We have something

486
39:49.368 --> 39:50.670
to tell you, Aunt Lanxiang.

487
39:57.810 --> 40:00.040
What is it that's so important that you need to tell me?

488
40:09.119 --> 40:10.599
Aunt Fengxian gave these to us.

489
40:11.976 --> 40:14.520
These are ritual vessels used for offerings to your grandmother.

490
40:14.639 --> 40:15.559
How did you get it?

491
40:16.599 --> 40:18.320
Madam Deng, who serves Aunt Fengxian,

492
40:18.920 --> 40:20.079
gave this to Yingzhi.

493
40:20.800 --> 40:21.559
She told Yingzhi

494
40:22.000 --> 40:23.360
to secretly hide it in your chest

495
40:23.480 --> 40:25.400
where you keep your personal clothes.

496
40:26.519 --> 40:29.039
Madam Deng said that now that the First Madam is gone,

497
40:29.640 --> 40:30.920
from now on, the Lin Residence

498
40:31.480 --> 40:33.239
will be managed by the Second Madam,

499
40:33.368 --> 40:35.230
which means Aunt Fengxian will be in charge.

500
40:35.719 --> 40:37.360
If I obediently do as I'm told,

501
40:37.528 --> 40:39.840
we'll be allowed to continue staying at the Lin Residence.

502
40:40.559 --> 40:41.800
If I don't,

503
40:42.639 --> 40:45.239
she'll drive all three of us out

504
40:46.119 --> 40:47.639
and leave us homeless on the streets.

505
40:50.440 --> 40:52.960
Aunt Fengxian not only looks down on us,

506
40:52.970 --> 40:55.210
but she has also looked down on you too, Aunt Lanxiang.

507
40:55.360 --> 40:57.760
Why don't we give her

508
40:58.360 --> 40:59.760
a taste of her own medicine?

509
41:00.280 --> 41:02.440
I'll slip this jade into Aunt Fengxian's room

510
41:02.920 --> 41:03.840
without her knowing...

511
41:03.840 --> 41:04.920
Absolutely not.

512
41:06.536 --> 41:08.910
Why shouldn't we let a wicked person suffer the consequences

513
41:08.920 --> 41:10.119
of her own actions?

514
41:11.639 --> 41:12.960
What Aunt Fengxian did to me

515
41:13.199 --> 41:14.039
was wrong.

516
41:14.559 --> 41:15.639
If I do the same thing,

517
41:16.320 --> 41:17.679
wouldn't that make me just like her

518
41:17.784 --> 41:19.288
and turn me into a wicked person, too?

519
41:20.056 --> 41:21.550
If we repay resentment with kindness,

520
41:22.760 --> 41:24.000
what do we repay kindness with?

521
41:31.880 --> 41:32.280
Come here.

522
41:35.119 --> 41:35.480
Sit down.

523
41:42.632 --> 41:43.760
Let me ask you something.

524
41:44.719 --> 41:45.880
What do the two of you

525
41:46.679 --> 41:47.719
live for?

526
41:56.480 --> 41:58.360
I live for my parents,

527
41:59.280 --> 42:01.559
for my daughter Zhangcheng,

528
42:02.280 --> 42:04.119
and above all, for myself.

529
42:18.960 --> 42:21.840
For the tender yellow-green shoots of spring,

530
42:24.440 --> 42:26.079
the evening breeze and stars of summer,

531
42:30.376 --> 42:32.150
the blue skies and red leaves of autumn,

532
42:33.640 --> 42:35.688
and the white snow and red plum blossoms of winter.

533
42:39.079 --> 42:41.639
For the first fresh river catch I taste each year.

534
42:41.760 --> 42:43.800
For pumpkins, sweet and soft.

535
42:47.736 --> 42:50.136
For the fireworks and firecrackers on Chinese New Year's Eve.

536
42:51.592 --> 42:54.030
For the wonderful plays performed by the Furong Troupe.

537
42:57.880 --> 42:59.719
I have so many reasons to live.

538
43:00.119 --> 43:00.920
What about you?

539
43:04.820 --> 43:07.380
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

540
43:25.100 --> 43:26.850
(Construction Supervisor, Ministry of Works)

541
43:46.060 --> 43:50.180
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

542
43:53.020 --> 43:57.540
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

543
43:58.820 --> 44:02.740
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

544
44:03.420 --> 44:06.180
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

545
44:06.900 --> 44:09.220
♪Though all the world may fade♪

546
44:09.220 --> 44:12.300
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

547
44:13.820 --> 44:18.060
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

548
44:20.980 --> 44:25.140
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

549
44:26.940 --> 44:30.500
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

550
44:30.500 --> 44:34.060
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

551
44:34.860 --> 44:40.540
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

552
44:40.900 --> 44:45.220
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

553
44:45.580 --> 44:48.540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

554
44:48.540 --> 44:52.300
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

555
44:52.300 --> 44:55.180
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

556
44:55.180 --> 44:59.260
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

557
44:59.260 --> 45:02.620
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

558
45:02.620 --> 45:06.380
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

559
45:06.380 --> 45:10.380
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

560
45:11.140 --> 45:15.300
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

561
45:15.300 --> 45:18.740
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

562
45:18.740 --> 45:22.380
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

563
45:22.380 --> 45:25.260
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

564
45:25.260 --> 45:29.340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

565
45:29.340 --> 45:32.700
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

566
45:32.700 --> 45:36.340
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

567
45:36.340 --> 45:44.140
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪
